# temporary dev/debug helpers.
#
# `*_fix*.py` was the pattern here, and it matched anything with "fix" inside a
# longer word: `test_swagger2_fixture.py` was written, formatted, run green,
# and silently never committed. An ignore rule that swallows a file whose name
# merely contains three letters is a rule that loses work without a message.
#
# Anchored to the shapes a scratch helper actually has instead.
fix_*.py
*_hotfix.py
tests/_dbg*.py
build/
web/dist/
.pr-summary.md
